  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The \"Frosted Scribe\" item is capable of being picked up by any player, regardless of whether or not it is currently being held. This is in contrast to all other items I have seen, which are exclusive to whomever is currently holding them. This is rather strange, especially considering that the Frosted Scribe provides direct utility, unlike most other items, which are exclusively cosmetic.\n\nPersonally, this has made using the Scribe as a method of communication difficult. In crowded lobbies, or with less than accommodating people around, it's almost a certainty that the pen will be taken from my hands partway through.\n\nI'm not sure if this is intended behaviour, but it doesn't align with the function of most other items and directly hurts the use of the Frosted Scribe as an accessibility feature.",
